<title>USA: First Alliance sets share buyback program.</title>
<headline>First Alliance sets share buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Alliance Corp said on Thursday its board approved share repurchase program of up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
</text>
